title: "Co-replicating iteron arrays filter plasmid copy-number noise without controlling copy number: code and result tables"
abstract: "Chemical-master-equation solver, table and figure scripts, and result tables for an
  exact stochastic analysis of iteron plasmid copy-number control with a co-replicating
  binding-site reservoir."
